PI request is triggered, and no feedback is provided to the user.\\r\\nRoot cause analysis revealed that the form is missing an onSubmit handler, preventing submission logic from executing.\\r\\nThis results in role scope configurations not being persisted, blocking user access control setup.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Screenshots\\r\\n<!-- Required if you are making UI changes. -->\\r\\n\\r\\n## Related Issue\\r\\n<!-- Paste the link to the Jira ticket here if one exists. -->\\r\\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5562\\r\\n<!-- https://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3- -->\\r\\n\\r\\n## Other\\r\\n<!-- Anything not covered above -->\\r\\n\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\\n\\n* **New Features**\\n  * Added validation requiring user and role to be selected before form submission, with error notifications for missing required fields.\\n\\n* **Bug Fixes**\\n  * Enhanced error handling to display detailed error messages when form submission fails.\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\",\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8be4301a-b2ed-4cb6-993c-212e07b1a00d","uuid":"c20cb1ef-0850-4c15-bc77-d2e87c5b29bb","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:15:34.893Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-stock-management-app\",\"number\":541,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(fix) O3-5647: Fix User Role Scope Save Functionality\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"slubwama\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-04T13:38:31.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-05-05T06:15:40.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-05-05T06:15:40.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-stock-management-app/pull/541\",\"mergeCommit\":\"c67e47060f34697bd5e9aa63389a35fc5df2eed8\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:51.669Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-5562\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"},{\"key\":\"O3-5647\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commit