{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019AWuhANBkPET4NMFBZZv6N","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-stock-management-app\",\"number\":542,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(fix) O3-5648: Wire up stock report submission and add missing patient/stock-item inputs\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"slubwama\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-04T19:29:52.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-05-17T17:28:02.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-05-17T17:28:02.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-stock-management-app/pull/542\",\"mergeCommit\":\"c9d7c101c64554474c6b32c734789362166eaf37\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:51.669Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-5648\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"c9d7c101c64554474c6b32c734789362166eaf37\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/stock-reports/generate-report/create-stock-report.workspace.tsx\",\"additions\":173,\"deletions\":10},{\"path\":\"src/stock-reports/report-validation-schema.ts\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":4},{\"path\":\"src/stock-reports/stock-reports.resource.ts\",\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":4},{\"path\":\"translations/en.json\",\"additions\":5,\"deletions\":0}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\r\\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\r\\n- [ ] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Summary\\r\\n\\r\\nStock report submission was broken end-to-end:\\r\\n\\r\\n- The `<Form>` had no `onSubmit` handler, so clicking Save did nothing.\\r\\n- `handleSave` read `report.reportSystemName`, which is not on the form schema, causing every report parameter dependent on the system name to resolve to `undefined` and the backend to receive null parameters.\\r\\n- The Patient and Stock Item inputs were never rendered, so report types requiring them could not be submitted.\\r\\n- The `location` field was required at the schema level even for report types that do not use it, blocking submission with a \\\"Location Required\\\" error on a hidden field.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis PR:\\r\\n- Wires `handleSubmit(handleSave)` to the form's `onSubmit`.\\r\\n- Looks up `reportSystemName` from `reportTypes` and threads it through the parameter builders.\\r\\n- Makes `location` optional in the schema and adds a parameter-aware required check inside `handleSave`.\\r\\n- Adds debounced Patient and Stock Item ComboBoxes backed by `/patient` and `/stockmanagement/stockitem`.\\r\\n- Reduces `useGetReports` polling from 1s to 15s (refresh) / 10s (dedupe) and falls back to `totalCount` for pagination.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Screenshots\\r\\n<!-- Before: form submission silently failing; After: ComboBox results, successful submission snackbar -->\\r\\n\\r\\n## Related Issue\\r\\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5648\\r\\n\\r\\n## Other\\r\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8be4301a-b2ed-4cb6-993c-212e07b1a00d","uuid":"8b250456-d7ab-4c56-b3df-25dd2dd45f37","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:15:36.147Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-stock-management-app\",\"number\":542,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(fix) O3-5648: Wire up stock report submission and add missing patient/stock-item inputs\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"slubwama\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-04T19:29:52.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-05-17T17:28:02.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-05-17T17:28:02.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-stock-management-app/pull/542\",\"mergeCommit\":\"c9d7c101c64554474c6b32c734789362166eaf37\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-23T18:59:51.669Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-5648\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"c9d7c101c64554474c6b32c734789362166eaf37\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/stock-reports/generate-report/create-stock-report.workspace.tsx\",\"additions\":173,\"deletions\":10},{\"path\":\"src/stock-reports/report-validation-schema.ts\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":4},{\"path\":\"src/stock-reports/stock-reports.resource.ts\",\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":4},{\"path\":\"translations/en.json\",\"additions\":5,\"deletions\":0}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\r\\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\r\\n- [ ] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Summary\\r\\n\\r\\nStock report submission was broken end-to-end:\\r\\n\\r\\n- The `<Form>` had no `onSubmit` handler, so clicking Save did nothing.\\r\\n- `handleSave` read `report.reportSystemName`, which is not on the form schema, causing every report parameter dependent on the system name to resolve to `undefined` and the backend to receive null parameters.\\r\\n- The Patient and Stock Item inputs were never rendered, so report types requiring them could not be submitted.\\r\\n- The `location` field was required at the schema level even for report types that do not use it, blocking submission with a \\\"Location Required\\\" error on a hidden field.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis PR:\\r\\n- Wires `handleSubmit(handleSave)` to the form's `onSubmit`.\\r\\n- Looks up `reportSystemName` from `reportTypes` and threads it through the parameter builders.\\r\\n- Makes `location` optional in the schema and adds a parameter-aware required check inside `handleSave`.\\r\\n- Adds debounced Patient and Stock Item ComboBoxes backed by `/patient` and `/stockmanagement/stockitem`.\\r\\n- Reduces `useGetReports` polling from 1s to 15s (refresh) / 10s (dedupe) and falls back to `totalCount` for pagination.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Screenshots\\r\\n<!-- Before: form submission silently failing; After: ComboBox results, successful submission snackbar -->\\r\\n\\r\\n## Related Issue\\r\\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5648\\r\\n\\r\\n## Other\\r\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019AWuhANBkPET4NMFBZZv6N","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
